          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker mono">Archive 2021 — 2025</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">Selected Photographs</h2>
          </div>
          <p style="max-width: 38ch; color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 0.92rem;">
            Select any plate to open the full-screen loupe inspector with camera notes, live luminance histogram, and print edition availability.
